    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/H98AHU7VJGVl-APLY0fKL9xERZvnCZDZl-sk7Sy7wUc.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{e}_1=\\sqrt{1-\\frac{75}{100}}=\\frac{5}{10}=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{e}_2=2 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~F}_1(6,1), \\mathrm{F}_2(-4,1) \\\\ & 2 \\mathrm{ae}_2=10 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{a}=\\frac{5}{2} \\Rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{a}=5 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\alpha=5 \\\\ & 4=1+\\frac{\\mathrm{b}^2}{\\mathrm{a}^2} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{b}^2=3 \\mathrm{a}^2 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~b}=\\sqrt{3} \\times \\frac{5}{2} \\\\ & \\beta=5 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ & 3 \\alpha^2+2 \\beta^2=3 \\times 25+2 \\times 25 \\times 3 \\\\ & =225\\end{aligned}$",
